# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-07-30: keep the PUBLIC tree to the METHOD -- the model, the data
# generator, the training loops, and the configs of the models we actually
# ship. Everything below is either bulk output, machine-specific operations,
# or paper/figure production: real work, but not what someone cloning this
# repo to use or check the method needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

